OL,3,GNEWSADrug dealer 'earning #500k' from
OL,4,Aprison cell
OL,5,
OL,6,FA drug dealer was making "between
OL,7,F#400,000 and #500,000 every two months"
OL,8,Fbefore he was found hanged in his cell
OL,9,Fat HMP Garth, in Lancashire, the
OL,10,FPrisons and Probation Ombudsman (PPO)
OL,11,Fhas said.
OL,13,FJohnpaul Digweed was sentenced to a
OL,14,F25-year sentence for supplying drugs in
OL,15,FJune 2022 and transferred to Garth,
OL,16,Fnear Leyland, the following month.
OL,18,FThe 36-year-old "was involved in
OL,19,Forganising drone deliveries of drugs
OL,20,Fand other illicit items", into the
OL,21,Fprison, a report said.
