OL,5,
OL,6,FThere was "significant evidence that he
OL,7,Fwas involved in prison drug culture",
OL,8,Fwas "wanted" by organised crime gangs
OL,9,Foutside the prison and was worried
OL,10,Fabout debts, it said.
